{"overview":"When Sheriff Jake sees a man at the safe and then finds the payroll gone, he trails him. Just as he is about to arrest him, the man saves his life. Still suspicious, he joins up with the man and later they learn that Melgrove, the towns leading citizen, is trying to take over the area's ranches by having his gang stop all incoming supply wagons. With the ranchers about to sell to Melgrove, the two newcomers say they will bring in provisions.","tagline":"He turned man-hunter to run down a gang of thieving scoundrels!","cast":[{"n":"John Wayne","c":"John Carruthers","p":"/4VmiGmCwSnratHtYmT2AyXrdQ64.jpg","q":"Q40531"},{"n":"Eleanor Hunt","c":"Betty Mason","p":"/dstXdRrUWIUZTheT79WWHZOa8Mu.jpg","q":"Q5354296"},{"n":"George 'Gabby' Hayes","c":"Sheriff Jake Withers","p":"/fnTYZNc8Vy7lLJs3xl5GWSHGVSA.jpg","q":"Q1277973"},{"n":"Edward Peil Sr.","c":"Malgrove","p":"/tkebpmT8PggXYd2Qu028umqEZzc.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Yakima Canutt","c":"Danti, the Polka Dot Bandit","p":"/j1KK4F240wbX1cL7Gg4mVBDKoiq.jpg","q":"Q563665"},{"n":"Lafe McKee","c":"Dan Mason","p":"/iDR6BFkx3vJY9dN3LA3bNTAK24J.jpg","q":"Q3216092"},{"n":"George Cleveland","c":"Hank - Innkeeper","p":"/xD8XBI4Va8HF6fpNpM2C2DHEL5w.jpg","q":"Q3101495"},{"n":"Earl Dwire","c":"Henchman","p":"/1DZox89bVEBbTC2yu5UBLNCvO6I.jpg","q":"Q5325828"},{"n":"George Nash","c":"Bridegroom","p":"/caA5I2ss9bJKPILaSPgUlJ6ptus.jpg","q":"Q21475218"},{"n":"Hank Bell","c":"Stage Driver","p":"/kJrAa6i3IK9I3AyNUOCRzuLh13P.jpg","q":"Q5648287"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Steel_(1934_film)","qid":"Q2280163","rel":{"US":{"d":"1934-05-10","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/jpu2pz490NilXjc0nMxnKKGKGU1.jpg","/gY75A5OHlqmeLbkL2bQuULB9Sss.jpg","/pwAVexNiWF9VW00dn87WXpdzT21.jpg","/ua2wSFAHqzQUEYLH2yUtM4qil0G.jpg"]}